cambrian-perception's organism, vendored for CV Mode (cv_processor.py, CV_CAMBRIAN=1).

Source:   https://github.com/thefangeddeity/cambrian-perception
Commit:   34d6380
Copied:   2026-09-26
Files:    fishbowl/ -- only the modules a live host needs (the organism, its
          eye, brain, body, the live actor and the lock HUD); no evolution
          loop, no sandbox, no detector of its own (the node's detections
          are its prey).
champion.json: the frozen champion shipped with this package -- the
          Tanzania lineage (full laptop-livecam), generation 253346. A local
          cambrian-perception's newer champion (CV_CAMBRIAN_CHAMPION) is
          adopted over it when present.

Upstream is cambrian-perception; this is a copy, never edited here. To
update: copy the same fishbowl/*.py files from a newer upstream commit,
refresh champion.json from a running cambrian-perception
(/dev/shm/cambrian-perception/champion.json), and update this file.
Needs only python3, numpy and OpenCV, which CV Mode already uses.
